  "name": "Houndmaster's Call strikes deal 315 base damage plus 55% ranged attack power",
  "contract": [
    "Changelog entries 71841 and 71842 (2026-08-25) raised Houndmaster's Call by 90 base damage (225 to 315 before",
    "level scaling) and its ranged attack power scaling from 35% to 55%. Two level-60 owners Call their",
    "Shadowhounds five times each on identical golems; one has +10000 ranged attack power. Partial resists and",
    "level scaling cancel in the ratio of their average non-crit strikes: (315 + 55% of 10237) / (315 + 55% of",
    "237) is about 13.5. The old base gives 16.6 and 35% gives 9.9. Expected: 12.4-14.6, checked as the inverse",
    "0.0685-0.0806."
  ],
